            "detailed_description": "Receiver was created for the 7-day FPS challenge to explore gun handling mechanics, randomized levels, and unordered storytelling. Armed only with a handgun and an audio cassette player, you must uncover the secrets of the Mindkill in a building complex infested with automated turrets and hovering shock drones.<br><br><strong>Watch the videos to learn more about our design experiments in this game!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Detailed simulations of a Colt 1911 pistol, S&amp;W Model 10 &quot;Victory&quot; revolver, and Glock 17 with full-auto mod<br></li><li>Taser robots and machine gun turrets with physically-based damage models<br></li><li>Ballistic modeling of ricochets and bullet drop<br></li><li>11 audio tapes to prepare you to defend yourself against the inevitable Mindkill event<br></li><li>Become literate in how guns actually operate</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "Receiver was created for the 7-day FPS challenge to explore gun handling mechanics, randomized levels, and unordered storytelling. Armed only with a handgun and an audio cassette player, you must uncover the secrets of the Mindkill in a building complex infested with automated turrets and hovering shock drones.<br><br><strong>Watch the videos to learn more about our design experiments in this game!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Detailed simulations of a Colt 1911 pistol, S&amp;W Model 10 &quot;Victory&quot; revolver, and Glock 17 with full-auto mod<br></li><li>Taser robots and machine gun turrets with physically-based damage models<br></li><li>Ballistic modeling of ricochets and bullet drop<br></li><li>11 audio tapes to prepare you to defend yourself against the inevitable Mindkill event<br></li><li>Become literate in how guns actually operate</li></ul>",
